// The system's web view (libwarp_webview beside warp, crates/warp-webview, card app-webview; macOS's WKWebView):
// `webview_show(html, title)` shows a page in a window till it is closed (1: refused under WARP_NO_WINDOW or CI),
// `webview_page_text(html)` is the text the page shows, read in a hidden web view. `use js` runs in that hidden view
// too (lib/native/foreign.c binds the host word foreign_call to libwarp_webview)
webview_show(html: text, title: text): i32 from 'warp_webview'
webview_page_text(html: text): text from 'warp_webview'
